1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:11,208
Speaking, task three. Story number 16: Water in the bathroom. What happened to Mrs Horáková yesterday? Tell the story from the pictures in the past tense.

2
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:13,950
What happened to Mrs Horáková yesterday?

3
00:00:34,667 --> 00:00:37,267
Yesterday morning Mrs Horáková wanted to take a shower.

4
00:00:37,467 --> 00:00:40,921
When she came into the bathroom, she saw water running from a pipe onto the floor.

5
00:00:41,133 --> 00:00:44,057
She quickly turned off the water and wiped the floor with a towel.

6
00:00:44,267 --> 00:00:47,100
She was afraid the water would leak down to the neighbours.

7
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:50,433
Then she called the flat owner and explained everything.

8
00:00:50,633 --> 00:00:52,867
The owner promised to send a plumber.

9
00:00:53,067 --> 00:00:56,267
In the afternoon the plumber came and repaired the pipe.

10
00:00:56,467 --> 00:01:01,231
Mrs Horáková had to go to work later, but she was glad everything was fine.

11
00:01:01,433 --> 00:01:10,469
Tell story 16 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
